there. The corruption in other games I've been recovering has also been
near options changes; I originally assumed it was a result of
reconnecting to the server (because that tends to have a change to the
autopickup setting as a consequence of bugs elsewhere in the version
that runs on the server), but this implies that it's to do with the
options change itself.

